  m_text: 'MODULE A:

    1. ROTATE THE 3 COLORED DIALS UNTIL THE COLORED DOTS (<color=#21FF0a>GREEN</color>,
    <color=#AF00AF>PURPLE</color>, ORANGE) FALL WITHIN THEIR CORRESPONDING ARC

    2.
    THE ARCS WILL SHIFT AND SHRINK IF CORRECT, REPEAT THE PROCESS FOR A TOTAL OF
    3 TIMES'
