  m_text: '- TO ACTIVATE SELF-DESTRUCT SEQUENCE:

    1. SET    SHIP STATUS TO <color=#FF0000>RED
    ALERT</color>

    2. SET THE 4-DIGIT CODE TO THE    <color=#00D5FF>PILOT</color>
    PREFIX CODE FOLLOWED BY THE    <color=#AF00AF>TACTICIAN</color> PREFIX CODE

    3.
    IF THE CODE IS CORRECT, TURN THE DIAL

    4. COUNTDOWN STARTS WITH THE OPTION
    TO ABORT'
